<view class="page"><image wx:if="{{background}}" class="paper-background" src="{{background}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="title">一起飞行吧！</view><view class="muted">四位好友 · 四部手机 · 同一张手绘棋盘</view><view class="card"><view>派对 · 好友飞行棋</view><image wx:if="{{boardArt}}" class="party-board" src="{{boardArt}}" mode="aspectFit"/><input maxlength="12" placeholder="你的游戏昵称（选填）" bindinput="nameInput"/><button bindtap="create" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">创建四人房间</button><view class="muted">建房后点击邀请好友，好友打开分享卡片即可加入。</view></view><view class="card"><input maxlength="32" placeholder="粘贴房间码" bindinput="roomInput"/><button bindtap="join" disabled="{{busy}}">加入好友房间</button><button wx:if="{{lastRoom}}" bindtap="resume">返回上一局</button></view><view class="error">{{error}}</view></view>
